# Arvid Tree

This is a static link hub built with React, TypeScript, and TanStack Start for Cloudflare Pages.

See README.md for the file layout, content editing, and deployment instructions. The app uses plain CSS, Lucide icons, and a local Mastodon SVG component.

Use the existing `@/` import alias. Keep TypeScript strict and run `npm run check` before committing. Do not edit `src/routeTree.gen.ts` manually.

Keep the orange from arvid.tech and the Arvid logo upright. Do not add divider lines, eyebrow labels, or duplicate website links.
